<title>NETHERLANDS: Lanschot keeps Hagemeyer as outperformer.</title>
<headline>Lanschot keeps Hagemeyer as outperformer.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of January research.</p>
<p>Company------------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Hagemeyer	    146.20  F van Lanschot</p>
<p>COMMENT: Impressive track-record. Well-balanced geographical and products spread, strong management information system. Company little sensitive to negative conjunctural influences. Van Lanschot says reiterates strong outperformance stance.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):    EPS	 P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	 5.90	24.8     2.00</p>
<p>    1996		    6.85	21.3     2.25</p>
<p>    1997		    7.95	18.4     2.60</p>
<p>    1998		    8.85	16.5     3.00</p>
